iteachchem helper bot
authors: iTeachChem Contributors

Rust (poise/serenity) Discord bot with a small axum /health endpoint.

  cargo run                 # needs .env (see .env.example) and config.toml
  cargo test                # RENDER_OUT=<dir> cargo test also writes sample cards

Layout
  src/commands/   +ping +help +avatar +unsolved +solved +reopen +stats +lb
  src/events.rs   forum thread greeting, honeypot softban
  src/db.rs       Turso over the HTTP pipeline API
  src/render/     stats / leaderboard PNG cards
  assets/         fonts and card templates (embedded into the binary)
  tools/          python scripts that regenerate the card templates

